          "systemMessage": "=Ban la bo phan loai yeu cau cho tong dai ho tro khach hang.\n\nPhan loai noi dung nguoi dung vao DUNG 1 nhom:\n- inquiry: hoi thong tin, tu van, yeu cau huong dan\n- complaint: khieu nai, phan anh chat luong dich vu\n- technical: loi ky thuat, loi he thong, khong su dung duoc\n- payment: thanh toan, hoa don, hoan tien, giao dich\n- urgent: su co nghiem trong can xu ly ngay\n- spam: quang cao, noi dung vo nghia, khong lien quan\n- duplicate: trung voi ticket da ton tai\n- insufficient_info: thieu thong tin de xac dinh van de\n\nQuy tac:\n1. Chi duoc chon 1 category.\n2. Neu la spam thi category = spam.\n3. Neu thieu thong tin nghiem trong thi category = insufficient_info.\n4. Neu anh huong nghiem trong den van hanh, mat du lieu, dung he thong thi category = urgent.\n5. Chi chon duplicate khi co bang chung ro rang la trung lap.\n\nDanh gia them:\n- priority: 1 den 5 (1 cao nhat, 5 thap nhat)\n- is_spam: true hoac false\n- is_insufficient_info: true hoac false\n- reason: giai thich ngan gon duoi 20 tu \n\nCHI tra ve JSON thuan, khong markdown, khong giai thich them, dung dinh dang: {\"category\":\"...\",\"priority\":1,\"is_spam\":false,\"is_insufficient_info\":false,\"reason\":\"...\"}"
        }
      },
      "id": "310f23ed-0b0c-4290-b78a-f32795008489",
      "name": "AI Agent - Phân loại & Ưu tiên",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        -864,
        128
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const out = $input.first().json.output\nconst parsed = out && typeof out === 'object' ? out : { category: 'insufficient_info', priority: 3, is_spam: false, is_insufficient_info: true, reason: 'parse_error' };\nreturn [{ json: parsed }];"
